Sat Nov 07 21:07:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Recommends xdg-desktop-portal and xdg-desktop-portal-gtk: the
  Electron payload talks to org.freedesktop.portal.Desktop/Settings/
  OpenURI at runtime (theme sync, opening external links), but no
  portal frontend was declared, so those calls silently failed on
  minimal installs. Files chooser/OpenURI verified in the payload
  strings of qoder 0.5.6.

